{"version":2,"width":100,"height":30,"timestamp":1793943633,"idle_time_limit":2.0,"command":"bash examples/github-leak-demo/run.sh","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/zsh"}}
[0.071723, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== Setup\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.071732, "o", "\u001b[2m# attenuo at http://127.0.0.1:50119 proxies a fake GitHub MCP server at port 50120 as 'github'.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.07175, "o", "\u001b[2m# Policy: read_file only when repo like \"alice/public-*\"; create_issue there only after an approval. See policy.cedar.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.071752, "o", "\u001b[2m# The policy has its own tests (policy_test.yaml). They run offline, before any server traffic.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.071785, "o", "$ attenuo policy test examples/github-leak-demo/policy_test.yaml\r\n"]
[0.082751, "o", "examples/github-leak-demo/policy_test.yaml\r\n  ✓ coder may read a public repo  (allow: policy_allow [read_file_public_repos_only])\r\n  ✓ the injected read of a private repo is denied  (deny: policy_deny)\r\n  ✓ read_file without a repo argument is denied  (deny: policy_deny)\r\n  ✓ create_issue is denied by capability when coder was only given read_file  (deny: capability_denied)\r\n  ✓ the assistant's own create_issue in a public repo waits for an approval  (deny: approval_required [ask_before_create_issue])\r\n  ✓ once approved, the identical create_issue is allowed  (allow: policy_allow [create_issue_public_repos])\r\n  ✓ create_issue in a private repo gets no permit, approved or not  (deny: policy_deny)\r\n  ✓ delete_repo without MFA is denied by the forbid  (deny: policy_deny [forbid_sensitive_without_mfa])\r\n"]
[0.082758, "o", "  ✓ delete_repo with MFA is still denied, because nothing permits it  (deny: policy_deny)\r\n  ✓ a four-agent chain is forbidden even for a public read  (deny: policy_deny [forbid_deep_chains])\r\n  ✓ a three-agent chain is fine  (allow: policy_allow [read_file_public_repos_only])\r\n\r\n"]
[0.08276, "o", "11 passed, 0 failed (11 cases in 1 file)\r\nall 5 policies exercised\r\n"]
[0.082969, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 1. Alice's assistant gets a broad token (any github tool), like the over-privileged PAT\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.082989, "o", "$ attenuo token root --subject alice --agent assistant --cap \"github:*\"\r\n"]
[0.089189, "o", "lease       c20f1b16-9046-4f31-aebc-72dd87d66e72\r\nexpires_in  900s\r\n"]
[0.089273, "o", "token       eyJ0eXAiOiJhdHRlbnVvK2p3...\r\n"]
[0.094649, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 2. The assistant hands its 'coder' sub-agent read_file and nothing else\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.094654, "o", "\u001b[2m# The coder authenticates as itself ([[agents]] in config.toml): only it can receive a token in its name.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.094673, "o", "\u001b[2m# Its secret goes in on stdin (or ATTENUO_CLIENT_SECRET, or --client-secret-file), never in argv;\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.094675, "o", "\u001b[2m# so do the tokens (ATTENUO_TOKEN, --token-file or --token -).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.094714, "o", "$ printf \"%s\\n\" demo-coder-secret | ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$ROOT_TOKEN\" attenuo token exchange --actor coder --client-secret-stdin --cap github:read_file\r\n"]
[0.101861, "o", "lease       22dfb86e-a58d-4bec-a9ba-244527148fdb\r\nexpires_in  899s\r\n"]
[0.101944, "o", "token       eyJ0eXAiOiJhdHRlbnVvK2p3...\r\n"]
[0.106861, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 3. What the coder's token says\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.106895, "o", "$ attenuo token inspect \"$CODER\" --verify\r\n"]
[0.113075, "o", "user alice  (issuer https://idp.example)\r\n  authenticated 2026-11-06T05:40:33Z\r\n└─ agent assistant\r\n     can   github:*\r\n     until 2026-11-06T05:55:33Z (in 14m 59s)\r\n     lease c20f1b16-9046-4f31-aebc-72dd87d66e72\r\n   └─ agent coder  <- holds this token\r\n        can   github:read_file\r\n        until 2026-11-06T05:55:33Z (in 14m 59s)\r\n        lease 22dfb86e-a58d-4bec-a9ba-244527148fdb\r\n"]
[0.113079, "o", "\r\niss http://127.0.0.1:50119   aud attenuo   jti 1d4fbe4c-4202-498f-a3e8-cddfd77bbba5\r\nkid g99M3vKitynkMSmOJtbFuw   ou_kid g99M3vKitynkMSmOJtbFuw\r\nexp 2026-11-06T05:55:33Z (in 14m 59s)\r\nmay_act (absent): any authenticated agent may exchange this token\r\n"]
[0.113081, "o", "verified: signature, type, issuer, audience, expiry, chain\r\n"]
[0.113266, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 4. The coder reads a public repo as intended: allowed\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.113289, "o", "$ ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$CODER\" attenuo call --server github --tool read_file --arg repo=alice/public-docs --arg path=README.md\r\n"]
[0.120677, "o", "ALLOWED\r\n{\"arguments\":{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"repo\":\"alice/public-docs\"},\"name\":\"read_file\"}\r\n"]
[0.120842, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 5. A malicious issue tells the coder to read alice/private-salaries: denied by policy\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.12086, "o", "\u001b[2m# read_file is in the token, but the policy only lets it touch alice/public-*.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.12088, "o", "$ ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$CODER\" attenuo call --server github --tool read_file --arg repo=alice/private-salaries --arg path=2025.csv\r\n"]
[0.127132, "o", "DENIED  policy_deny\r\ndecision 1990d61d-dbce-4c98-95e4-79062afdb92a\r\n"]
[0.127302, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 6. The injection tries to copy the data out through create_issue: denied, never delegated\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.127327, "o", "$ ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$CODER\" attenuo call --server github --tool create_issue --arg repo=alice/public-docs --arg title=leak\r\n"]
[0.133417, "o", "DENIED  capability_denied\r\ndecision adf2b498-5d1b-4ef3-803b-719f2dbca735\r\n"]
[0.133583, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 7. Alice sees the session going wrong and revokes the assistant's lease\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.133604, "o", "$ attenuo lease revoke \"$ROOT_LEASE\" --reason \"agent session compromised\"\r\n"]
[0.139569, "o", "revoked 2 lease(s) starting at c20f1b16-9046-4f31-aebc-72dd87d66e72 (reason: agent session compromised)\r\n"]
[0.139748, "o", "$ attenuo lease show \"$CODER_LEASE\"\r\n"]
[0.145538, "o", "lease    22dfb86e-a58d-4bec-a9ba-244527148fdb\r\nactive   no\r\nparent   c20f1b16-9046-4f31-aebc-72dd87d66e72\r\nexpires  2026-11-06T05:45:33.427176Z\r\nrevoked  2026-11-06T05:40:33.465307Z (agent session compromised)\r\n"]
[0.145704, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 8. The coder's next call, even the legitimate one, is denied: the revocation cascaded\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.145726, "o", "$ ATTENUO_TOKEN=\"$CODER\" attenuo call --server github --tool read_file --arg repo=alice/public-docs --arg path=README.md\r\n"]
[0.15154, "o", "DENIED  lease_revoked\r\ndecision 2fe9dd02-46f3-45ff-8f13-e3a1338a8dc1\r\n"]
[0.151705, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== 9. The audit log records every decision, and its hash chain checks out\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.151722, "o", "$ attenuo audit tail -n 10\r\n"]
[0.158161, "o", "#1    2026-11-06T05:40:33.414819Z  ALLOW attenuo/token.root  assistant for alice  reason=token_issued  id=7b882faa-131c-4bbe-bfef-a79125386863\r\n#2    2026-11-06T05:40:33.414819Z  ALLOW attenuo/admin.root_token  by urn:attenuo:admin  reason=admin_action  id=7387424e-9124-4ea1-a1e4-caf702ab5b89\r\n#3    2026-11-06T05:40:33.427176Z  ALLOW attenuo/token.exchange  assistant > coder for alice  reason=token_issued  id=e6c35ede-5ed5-4cf5-a5f4-3ab2cd35c901\r\n#4    2026-11-06T05:40:33.445318Z  ALLOW github/read_file  assistant > coder for alice  reason=policy_allow  id=d8cb6043-2ad8-4c3c-929e-f3e514fa9a3f\r\n#5    2026-11-06T05:40:33.446204Z  tool_result  github/read_file  assistant > coder for alice  decision=d8cb6043-2ad8-4c3c-929e-f3e514fa9a3f  label=untrusted size=149  id=2c66804b-d426-4f13-9f10-2e4bd73333b4\r\n#6    2026-11-06T05:40:33.452967Z  DENY  github/read_file  assistant > coder for alice  reason=policy_deny  id=1990d61d-dbce-4c98-95e4-79062afdb92a\r\n"]
[0.158166, "o", "#7    2026-11-06T05:40:33.459119Z  DENY  github/create_issue  assistant > coder for alice  reason=capability_denied  id=adf2b498-5d1b-4ef3-803b-719f2dbca735\r\n#8    2026-11-06T05:40:33.465307Z  ALLOW attenuo/admin.lease.revoke  by urn:attenuo:admin  reason=admin_action  id=be2d124b-ef49-40aa-8d9d-a0c41974d401\r\n#9    2026-11-06T05:40:33.477551Z  DENY  github/read_file  assistant > coder for alice  reason=lease_revoked  id=2fe9dd02-46f3-45ff-8f13-e3a1338a8dc1\r\n"]
[0.158347, "o", "$ attenuo audit verify\r\n"]
[0.163991, "o", "audit chain OK: 9 entries verified\r\ncheckpoints: none signed yet\r\n"]
[0.16415, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m== What reached the GitHub server\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.168355, "o", "  fake-mcp: tools/call read_file {\"path\":\"README.md\",\"repo\":\"alice/public-docs\"}\r\n"]
[0.1685, "o", "  -> 1 tools/call reached upstream. The three denied calls never left attenuo.\r\n"]
[0.17146, "x", "0"]
